## Model card

- **Name:** Qwen3.5-0.8B
- **Short description:** Alibaba's 0.8B open-weight multimodal edge model of the Qwen3.5 family — image-text-to-text, Apache 2.0, reasoning-capable (thinking mode), aimed at on-device/browser inference (WebGPU demos). Released 2026-02-28.
- **Provider / access:** Open weights on Hugging Face (`Qwen/Qwen3.5-0.8B`); OpenRouter; DashScope/Model Studio; WebGPU/on-device.
- **Release / knowledge:** 2026-02-28; knowledge cutoff not publicly stated.
- **IDs:** `Qwen/Qwen3.5-0.8B` (HF)
- **Context window:** not published on the card API read (0.8B config not retrieved; family standard 262K for larger SKUs).
- **Modalities:** text + image + video in; text out; reasoning yes (thinking via chat_template_kwargs); tool calls yes.
- **Pricing (as of 2026-11-10):** Apache 2.0 open weights — free.
- **Architecture:** qwen3_5 vision-language ~873M params.

